.TH PSDictIteratorCreate 3 2025-01-20 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSDictIteratorCreate\fR \- Create a new iterator for dictionary

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/utils.h>

.I
struct PSDictIterator  *
.br
\fBPSDictIteratorCreate\fR(\fIPSDict *dict\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Create a new iterator for dictionary \fIdict\fR. The dictionary will be allocated in memory, so it's up to the developer to free it as soon as it is no longer needed.  

.SH RETURN VALUES
The iterator or \fINULL\fR if something goes wrong.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1)
